  "description": "An experimental potion designed to grant superhero powers backfires on genius comic geek Kim Seo-Hee, leaving his body dramatically transformed. But his secretive junior, Seo Tae-Oh, is right there to lend a hand. Driven by years of unrequited love and hidden desire, Tae-Oh offers to \"test\" Seohee's sensitive new body. Caught in a trap set by his handsome junior, the naive senior finds himself helpless against Tae-Oh's scheming passion. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
